 "title": "Effective Cartier ideal",
 "statement": "A quasi-coherent ideal $\\mathcal I\\subseteq\\mathcal O_X$ is an\n*effective Cartier ideal* if, on an open cover, it has a generator\nwhich is a non-zero-divisor in the corresponding ring. Invertibility is\na consequence recorded separately below.",
